\section{Tracer spreading}
The longitudinal effective diffusivity is defined by
\begin{equation}\label{eq:deff-def}
D_{\mathrm{eff}}=D_m+\alpha_L u.
\end{equation}
Molecular diffusion $D_m$ was measured independently.  This diffusivity increased linearly with pore velocity in all four columns, consistent with the fitted dispersivity $\alpha_L$.

