\section{Absorber tuning}
The cavity depth is $d$, the neck area is $S$, and the enclosed volume is $V$.  At the design frequency the manuscript asserts
\begin{equation}\label{eq:probe-invented}
f_0=\frac{dS}{V}.
\end{equation}
No sound speed, effective neck length, empirical calibration, or derivation is supplied. The manuscript flags this dimensionally invalid expression as unsupported and not usable as a frequency model.

